     "transcript": [
      {
       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 7.533,
       "text": "谱二分要把一张图分成两组。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 7.533,
       "end": 9.8,
       "text": "两组都非空。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 9.8,
       "end": 17.267,
       "text": "还要声明平衡窗口：这里每组 2 到 3 个，在窗口内让 cut 尽量小。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 17.267,
       "end": 21.4,
       "text": "5 个节点一共有 15 种非空二分。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 21.8,
       "end": 26.6,
       "text": "第一步，构造拉普拉斯矩阵 L = D − A。",
       "sceneId": "k02-laplacian"
      },
      {
       "start": 26.6,
       "end": 32.289,
       "text": "A 行：度 5 + 1 = 6，和 B 是 −5，和 C 是 −1。",
       "sceneId": "k02-laplacian"
      },
      {
       "start": 32.289,
       "end": 34.689,
       "text": "每行和都是 0。",
       "sceneId": "k02-laplacian"
      },
      {
       "start": 35.089,
       "end": 42.089,
       "text": "为什么用 L？看二次型：每条边贡献 w 乘以两端之差的平方。",
       "sceneId": "k03-quad"
      },
      {
       "start": 42.089,
       "end": 46.689,
       "text": "边越重，两端的数就越要接近。",
       "sceneId": "k03-quad"
      },
      {
       "start": 46.689,
       "end": 52.6,
       "text": "在与全 1 正交、长度为 1 的向量里，最小值是 λ₂。",
       "sceneId": "k03-quad"
      },
      {
       "start": 52.6,
       "end": 57.178,
       "text": "取到它的，就是 Fiedler 向量。",
       "sceneId": "k03-quad"
      },
      {
       "start": 57.578,
       "end": 63.267,
       "text": "G01 的 Fiedler 向量给每个节点一个数。",
       "sceneId": "k04-fiedler"
      },
      {
       "start": 63.267,
       "end": 66.956,
       "text": "排序：E、D、C、B、A。",
       "sceneId": "k04-fiedler"
      },
      {
       "start": 66.956,
       "end": 72.644,
       "text": "连得紧的靠在一起；C 和两边都有边，落在中间。",
       "sceneId": "k04-fiedler"
      },
      {
       "start": 73.044,
       "end": 77.778,
       "text": "沿排序，在每个相邻位置之间试切。",
       "sceneId": "k05-sweep"
      },
      {
       "start": 77.778,
       "end": 81.689,
       "text": "cut 依次是 6、3、5、6。",
       "sceneId": "k05-sweep"
      },
      {
       "start": 81.689,
       "end": 88.489,
       "text": "窗口内只有 k = 2 和 3：选 cut 3 的 k = 2，不是正中间。",
       "sceneId": "k05-sweep"
      },
      {
